{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，忧郁……”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3561", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": "_ar6478", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女人真麻烦。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3562", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔天，教室里从早上就很安静。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道原因。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小濑名和小乾的情绪低落，结果影响到整间教室了。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "_ht1708", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。毕竟原本就是影响力很强的两人。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连总是给人活力充沛印象的安洁今天都很安静。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚才在走廊上遇到的时候，她好像很害怕似的逃走了。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还以为是我的脸上沾到什么了，但好像也不是。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔～这种时候就要去社团，让动物们疗愈心灵。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3563", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“休息时间结束前要回来喔。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 354, "voice": "_ar6479", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好好好，还有，我顺便带沙包一起去。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3564", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说完，纱凪拉住我的手。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“沙包是指我？”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不然还有谁？”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3565", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“除了新吾以外没有了呢～”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "_ht1709", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只在这种时候意气相投，隼太没良心地朝我挥了挥手。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“用揍的比较好？还是用踢的？或者甩巴掌？”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3566", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有其他选择啊。”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一般人会亲吻沙包吗？”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3567", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想是不会。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，所以就是这样。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3568", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪满意地笑了笑，狠踩我一脚。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，沙包快走吧！”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3569", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被这样称呼还觉得高兴的我，各种意义上好像都没救了……", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～果然还是这里最能平静下来。在教室里觉得好累。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3570", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为今天早上一到教室就被‘小纱凪被瓜生君公主抱了～？好羡慕喔～’的尖叫声包围。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3571", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是我还是有为你着想喔。要是随便找你讲话结果被误会也很麻烦吧。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3572", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用在意那种事没关系的说。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以在社团教室就不用在意了。应该说，我现在肚子痛得要死。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3573", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种时候，男人想帮忙也帮不上。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连那个纱凪都忍不住喊疼，一定是非常难受吧。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“身体不要着凉比较好。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，喂！外套你自己穿着啦！就算对我这么温柔，我……”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3574", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说到一半，纱凪的眼中就盈满了泪水。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，纱凪！？”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪出乎意料的反应让我很慌张，连忙靠近她。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……没什么啦，只是突然放松了。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3575", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其实今天早上也跟理央吵架了。我肚子很痛，理央又在说希望动物全部都死掉……”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3576", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许是一直绷紧的丝线突然断掉了。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪没有擦掉眼泪，抓紧我为她披上的外套。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我很担心理央。在最该跟父母撒娇的年纪却一个人待在家里。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3577", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“他的想法好像也和其他孩子不同……”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3578", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道他讨厌动物，可是那个年纪的小孩不会说什么希望全部都死掉吧？”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3579", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我懂纱凪的担忧。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我不知道理央君对纱凪说的话是不是真心的。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之前跟他聊天的时候，我觉得他是个会担心姐姐身体状况的温柔的孩子。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是对纱凪说不出口而已。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好险，差点就要对新吾哭诉了。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3580", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要是害纱凪哭了，我会被掐死吧。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那又不是真心说的……”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3581", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪揉了揉眼睛，背对我不让我看到表情。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“肚子痛好点了吗？”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有好。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3582", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那在这里坐一下吧？”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我刻意不提起理央君的事，现在我只担心纱凪的身体。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……干嘛，突然靠那么近……”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3583", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前我气喘很严重的时候，家人会在我发作时抚摸我的背。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样很让我安心，连痛苦都减轻了不少。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次换我用这个方法。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许你会很反感被男人这样做……”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、什么？等、你在摸哪里……唔啊啊！？”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3584", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手掌贴到纱凪的肚子上，缓缓地上下抚摸。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪非常惊讶，满脸通红地僵住了。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样抚摸的话，会不会稍微轻松一点？”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应、应该说，一般会突然摸别人的肚子吗……”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3585", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“老实说，我已经做好被揍飞的觉悟了。”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯！”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3586", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，很痛吗？”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不是！刚才的声音没什么意思！莫名就擅自发出声音……”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3587", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比起那个，你好像很习惯啊？该不会对爱理她们也……”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3588", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有没有。我也是第一次对女孩子做这种事。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也……被人这样做还是第一次……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3589", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这么近的距离对视，我们都沉默了。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我本来想说如果她有一丝反感我就停手，没想到纱凪很舒服似的靠着我。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“疼痛好像舒缓了一点……”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3590", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？太好了。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……真的搞不懂男人。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3591", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为昨天公主抱的时候，你好像用尽全力的感觉，现在却完全没有……”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3592", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“肚、肚子痛的时候被这么温柔抚摸，就算想生气也气不起来……”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3593", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，你的脸总是靠太近了。你绝对是故意的吧！”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3594", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "见她出现一点类似反感的反应，我缩回了手。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是纱凪站起身背对我，自己用手抚摸腹部。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可恶，又被你夺走了我的第一次……”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3595", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不只是公主抱，连摸肚子都容许了……”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3596", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“差不多是沙包出场的时候了吧。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“吵死了！就算把新吾你当沙包，我的‘第一次’也不会回来了！”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3597", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“既然如此，我总有一天要复仇。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3598", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“复、复仇？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 352, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然没办法公主抱你，但是我一定要把你摸个遍！”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3599", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算道歉我也不会原谅你的！我要把你摸到哭喊着‘请住手！’，让你明白我的可怕！”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "_sn3600", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉不太对劲的复仇，我也不知道怎么回应。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那不是复仇而是奖励吧，但是这件事我撕裂嘴巴也不会跟她本人说。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0251", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜？”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 353, "voice": "_pn0596", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你是熊喵吧。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0252", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～？”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 353, "voice": "_pn0597", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0253", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有忘记你背叛了我的事。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0254", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“背叛者就要接受惩罚。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0255", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 353, "voice": "_pn0598", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天起，你就是我的东西了。要听从我的命令。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0256", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“知道了吗，熊喵？”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0257", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜、噜……”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 353, "voice": "_pn0599", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果下次再背叛，到时候……”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0258", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route03_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我会把你──”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 355, "voice": "_ri0259", "char_id": "理央"}]}
